# Shipping IMPEX (shipping.xsd)

Before changing shipping-method XML builders, **read** `.cursor/references/sfcc-xsd/shipping.xsd`. Sequences are ordered. A valid element in the wrong place fails import (`cvc-complex-type.2.4.a`).

Namespace: `http://www.demandware.com/xml/impex/shipping/2007-03-31` (note **2007**, not 2006). Root is `<shipping>` containing `<shipping-method>` children. Skip empty optional elements. Do not invent tags.

## Shipping method (`ShippingMethod`)

`method-id` is required. Optional `default` boolean.

`display-name` → `description` → `online-flag` → `base-method` → `external-shipping-method` (max **28**) → `tax-class-id` → `price-table` → `product-cost-groups` → `excluded-products` → `excluded-addresses` → **`custom-attributes`** → **`currency`** → `customer-groups`

`currency` comes **after** `custom-attributes`, not before. Do not move it earlier.

`display-name` and `description` are `LocalizedString` (`xml:lang`). Custom attributes may also take `xml:lang`.

## Price table

Choice of `<amount order-value="…">` and/or `<percentage order-value="…">` (unbounded). Amounts are `xsd:decimal` ≥ 0.

## Product / address exclusions

`excluded-products` / product-cost-group `products`: `included-products` (required) → optional `excluded-products`, each wrapping `condition-group` filters (`brand-condition`, `product-id-condition`, `category-condition`, …). Category filters require `catalog-id`.

`excluded-addresses`: `included-addresses` (required) → optional `excluded-addresses`. Condition groups require `match-mode` (`all` | `any`).

## Product cost groups

`product-cost-group` → `products` → optional `cost-per-item` (`fixed-price` | `surcharge`).

**Runtime maps** (Check Attributes `attrIdMap_shippingMethod`): XML generation applies source → SFCC id at write time. OOTB targets (`taxClassID`, `displayName`, …) become shipping-method elements; custom targets become `<custom-attribute>`. Never emit OOTB ids as custom-attributes.

Builder: `shippingMethodXmlBuilder.js`.
